%% System context: who uses Empathia and what it connects to. Planned integrations are CONTRACT_ONLY or MOCK today.
flowchart LR
  subgraph People
    REQ[Requestors and employees]
    ENG[Designers, systems and commissioning engineers]
    OPS[Operations, service managers and technicians]
    EXE[Executives and finance]
    ADM[Security and platform admins]
  end
  EMP[[Empathia platform<br/>web app + enterprise API]]
  REQ --> EMP
  ENG --> EMP
  OPS --> EMP
  EXE --> EMP
  ADM --> EMP
  subgraph External["External systems (all CONTRACT_ONLY / MOCK today)"]
    IDP[(Identity provider<br/>OIDC)]
    ITSM[(ITSM / service desk)]
    AV[(AV, DSP and control platforms)]
    NET[(Network and device management)]
    BMS[(Building management)]
    M365[(Collaboration suite)]
  end
  EMP -. authenticate .-> IDP
  EMP -. read-only ingest .-> ITSM
  EMP -. read-only telemetry .-> AV
  EMP -. read-only inventory .-> NET
  EMP -. read-only .-> BMS
  EMP -. links only .-> M365
